-- 2. The target does not stand in the official text on a day long after the deletion.
#ASSERT `the target stands in the official text on` (`reference: s 1יג(ד)(2) to NII s 223א, a suspended permit`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
